  "description": "CoAP (RFC 7252) for IoTCom.Net: client and server over UDP with confirmable retransmission, deduplication, separate responses, Observe (RFC 7641), Block-wise transfers (RFC 7959), CoRE Link Format discovery (RFC 6690), SenML payloads and a greenhouse device simulator. The codec is mirrored by a fuzzed Rust crate through shared conformance vectors. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
